  "readme": "## README.md\n# Field boundaries for Mecklenburg-Western Pomerania (MV), Germany\n\nProvides ca. 70.000 official field boundaries from the federal state of Mecklenburg-Western Pomerania (MV) in Germany.\nIt has been converted to a fiboa GeoParquet file from a file that was provided by the state.\n\n- **Source Data Provider:** [Ministerium f\u00fcr Landwirtschaft und Umwelt M-V](https://www.geodaten-mv.de/dienste/feldblock_atom?type=dataset&id=f18122c4-2585-4c22-9c48-9e960e8dhd34)\n- **Converted by:** [Matthias Mohr](https://mohr.ws)\n- **License:** No restrictions apply\n\n---\n\n- **[Download the data as fiboa GeoParquet](https://data.source.coop/fiboa/de-mv/de-mv.parquet)**\n- [STAC Browser](https://radiantearth.github.io/stac-browser/#/external/data.source.coop/fiboa/de-mv/stac/collection.json)\n- [STAC Collection](https://data.source.coop/fiboa/de-mv/stac/collection.json)\n- [PMTiles](https://data.source.coop/fiboa/de-mv/de-mv.pmtiles)\n\n## Lineage\n\n- Data downloaded on 2024-11-05 from https://www.geodaten-mv.de/dienste/gdimv_feldblock_wfs?SERVICE=WFS&VERSION=1.1.0&REQUEST=GetFeature&TYPENAME=mv:feldbloecke&OUTPUTFORMAT=shape-zip.\n- Converted to GeoParquet using [fiboa-cli](https://github.com/fiboa/cli), version 0.7.0.\n",
